<title>INDIA: India Godavari sets 96/97 div at 10 pct.</title>
<headline>India Godavari sets 96/97 div at 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Godavari Fertilisers and Chemicals Ltd will pay a maiden dividend of 10 percent for 1996/97 (April-March), the Press Trust of India said on Friday.</p>
</text>
